Source: wsl-relay-gpg
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Artiom Cozlovici <kozakovi4@outlook.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/Art1xFX/WSL-Relay-GPG

Package: wsl-relay-gpg
Architecture: all
Depends: gpg, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Relay GnuPG sockets from WSL to Windows
 systemd user socket units that expose the gpg-agent, ssh-agent, dirmngr
 and keyboxd sockets inside WSL and forward every connection to the
 matching socket of the Windows GnuPG installation through npiperelay.
